# --- Grim Dawn game data ------------------------------------------------------
# devotions.raw.json is a verbatim extract of Crate Entertainment's DBR records.
# Crate's stated position is that shipping core game databases copied out of the
# install is not on, while your own derived records built with their toolset are
# fine -- so the raw dump stays local and the derived index is committed.
#
# Regenerate it from your own legally owned installation:
#   node scripts/extract.mjs <folder containing records/ and text/>
devotions.raw.json

